    "updated_at": "2020-08-10T21:04:37Z",
    "body": "Note that given [WebKit's tracking prevention policy](https://webkit.org/tracking-prevention-policy/), we would not be able to re-introduce BroadcastChannel until this issue is resolved. Furthermore, I *think* Mozilla has implemented this behavior in Gecko so there appear to be two implementor interests in this regard. I'm not certain if Google / Chrome has done the same. Does anyone know?",
