    "created_at": "2020-08-14T06:19:11Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-08-14T06:19:11Z",
    "body": "See also discussion in https://github.com/privacycg/storage-partitioning/issues/9 (and https://github.com/whatwg/storage/issues/88 for storage APIs, though how that mechanism should work with broadcast channel is a bit unclear to me still). Our current approach is that the key depends on the storage access permission. I think currently if an origin has a transition from partitioned to non-partitioned it might have channels with two different keys. We've considered closing the channel with the partitioned key at that point.\r\n\r\ncc @bakulf",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
