    "body": "To follow-up on this, I am currently implementing origin-partitioning for BroadcastChannel in WebKit:\r\n- [Bug 229814](https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=229814) (partitioning)\r\n- [Bug 230164](https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=230164) (relaxing based on requestStorageAccess)",
