    "created_at": "2023-12-01T11:29:33Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-12-01T11:29:33Z",
    "body": "For Chrome, you should [register an origin trial](https://developer.chrome.com/origintrials/#/view_trial/-8517432795264450559) to disable third party storage partitioning.\r\nYou can keep an eye out for [the Storage Access API proposal](https://arichiv.github.io/saa-non-cookie-storage/) for future updates on this issue.",
